{title: Great is his steadfast love}
{subtitle: Psalms 117:1–2}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 75}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Eb] | [Bb] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]All you na[Bbmaj7/D]tions praise the [Eb]LORD
Ex[Bb]tol him all you [Dm]peoples [Eb]here
[Gm]His love [F]is great toward [Eb]us
[Cm7]His faithful[Bb/D]ness endures [F]forever
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Praise the LORD [F]all you na[Eb]tions
[Bb]Extol him all [F]you peo[Eb]ples
[Gm]Great is his [F]steadfast [Eb]love
[Cm7]Faithfulness en[F]dures forev[Bb]er [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]No [Dm]border stops this [Eb]song
No [Bb]people left [Dm]be[Eb]hind
The [Gm]LORD is [F]faithful [Eb]still
[Cm7]To us [Bbmaj7/D]his love is [F]kind
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Praise the LORD [F]all you na[Eb]tions
[Bb]Extol him all [F]you peo[Eb]ples
[Gm]Great is his [F]steadfast [Eb]love
[Cm7]Faithfulness en[F]dures forev[Bb]er
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb]His love [F]is great toward [Gm]us
[Eb]His faithful[F]ness never [Gm]ends
Praise [Eb]the LORD [F]
{end_of_bridge}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Cm7]En[F]dures forev[Bb]er [Eb][Bb]
[Eb]Praise the [Bb]LORD
{end_of_verse}
